# Docs sync — one file list

When the ask is `11-sync-product-docs` (fold Unreleased, align README, CHANGELOG, `.ai/context`, site version):

- Open only the files that command names. One `npm test` at the end if the snapshot needs a count.
- Do not open `site/i18n.js` except to replace the version string, and do not patch `src/i18n/catalogs/` or `media/history.html` in that turn.
- A sentence that disagrees with the code gets one named file, not every locale.
